From: silentsudin <25103587+silentsudin@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] oxp: volume rocker taps in controller mode too

0001 enabled the taps only for the AT keyboard of the turbo-only loop;
in controller mode (normal use) the keyboard was stock, and with atkbd
force-release hhd kept only the releases, so the rocker did nothing.
---
diff --git a/hhd/device/oxp/base.py b/hhd/device/oxp/base.py
index b42227f..ebf1399 100644
--- a/hhd/device/oxp/base.py
+++ b/hhd/device/oxp/base.py
@@ -711,6 +711,7 @@ def controller_loop(
             required=False,
             grab=True,
             btn_map=mappings,
+            volume_taps=dconf.get("quirk") == "oxp3",
         )
     ]
     if dconf.get("protocol", None) == "hid_v2_x2" or dconf.get("quirk") == "apex":
